<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day</p>
<p>of the third and final cricket test between India and South</p>
<p>Africa on Tuesday:</p>
<p>India first innings first innings 237 (S.Tendulkar 61,</p>
<p>W.Raman 57; P.Adams 6-55)</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 177 (A.Kumble 4-71, J.Srinath</p>
<p>3-42)</p>
<p>India second innings (overnight 7-1)</p>
<p> W.Raman lbw b De Villiers		2</p>
<p> N.Mongia lbw b Klusener		 18</p>
<p> A.Kumble c Gibbs b De Villiers	42</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c McMillan b Symcox	 41</p>
<p>S.Tendulkar c Richardson b Klusener 36</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin batting		    88</p>
<p> R.Dravid batting			  33</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-5 nb-1)		  10</p>
<p> Total (for 5 wickets, 94 overs)    270</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-2 2-41 3-91 4-121 5-192</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): De Villiers 21-10-49-2 (2nb), Klusener</p>
<p>22-6-62-2, McMillan 16-6-36-0, Cronje 10-4-15-0, Adams</p>
<p>12-0-57-0, Symcox 13-1-42-1.</p>
